{"version":1,"content":"<p>在Meta、Google等科技巨頭持續推動AI眼鏡發展的背景下，一家名為Raven Resonance的初創企業推出了一款與眾不同的智能眼鏡產品。該公司最新展示的Raven Prism並未選擇依賴智能手機或封閉生態系統，而是將產品定位為一台能夠佩戴在臉上的完整Linux電腦，希望為開發者、創作者以及重視私隱的用户提供另一種智能穿戴設備選擇。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584868.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T11:43:03.208654+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":176,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T11:23:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T11:38:27.495608+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T11:38:27.495608+00:00","content_hash":"0206c60659f527976a0125c2233a0972181eaf3deff1174c0d29a06d63170c18","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}